        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso",
          "value": "<p>To our elder and our noted one, the honorable, holy, our master and teacher Solomon the doctor, son of the master R. Eli\u2014his rest be in the garden of Eden\u2014the respected elder. The Rock keep him, and may he be protected from all harm. A great deliverance!</p>\n<p></p>",
